6","quote":"楷長兄黎，次兄康，並知名。康子盾，少曆顯位。永嘉中，為徐州刺史，委任長史司馬奧。奧勸盾刑殺立威，大發良人為兵，有不奉法者罪便至死。在任三年，百姓嗟怨。東海王越，盾妹夫也。越既薨，騎督滿衡便引所發良人東還。尋而劉元海遣將王桑、趙固向彭城，前鋒數騎至下邳，文武不堪苛政，悉皆散走，盾、奧奔淮陰，妻子為賊人所得。奧又誘盾降趙固。固妻盾女，有寵，盾向女涕泣，固遂殺之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0015","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0013"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"named_parent_son","roles":{"parent":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0013","child":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0015"},"clause_start":13,"clause_end":16,"paragraph_sha256":"8f2f5b84d2a58e9b2a2f4bab0e8538b1eb37c85e790c1f57bfacc84a904be772","revision_id":2506399},"lineage":"paternal"},"interpretation_note":"只記完整原文所述及限定的上下文指涉；不由婚配、排行或宗祧承繼推未載生母、父系世距或法律收養。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin035-pei-dun-sister","subject_person_id":"0z1_dy8_dft","predicate":"sister","object_person_id":"gul_dv0_595","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peikai-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016","quote":"楷長兄黎，次兄康，並知名。康子盾，少曆顯位。永嘉中，為徐州刺史，委任長史司馬奧。奧勸盾刑殺立威，大發良人為兵，有不奉法者罪便至死。在任三年，百姓嗟怨。東海王越，盾妹夫也。越既薨，騎督滿衡便引所發良人東還。尋而劉元海遣將王桑、趙固向彭城，前鋒數騎至下邳，文武不堪苛政，悉皆散走，盾、奧奔淮陰，妻子為賊人所得。奧又誘盾降趙固。固妻盾女，有寵，盾向女涕泣，固遂殺之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0081","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0080"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"妹夫","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"named_siblings_sister_husband","roles":{"husband":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0075","brother":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0080","sister":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p016:m0081"},"clause_start":75,"clause_end":85,"paragraph_sha256":"8f2f5b84d2a58e9b2a2f4bab0e8538b1eb37c85e790c1f57bfacc84a904be772","revision_id":2506399},"relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"gul_